        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms Deluxe 2 is a spin on The Backrooms Deluxe with new features such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match positive and negative effects that give you more or less Deluxe Coins at the end of your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Much better multiplayer replication</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game has been rewritten to support a much more seamless multiplayer experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has received more achievements, as well as support for non-Steam achievements (only in the game but don't affect Steam progression) for harder challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the original game, permadeath has been added, which adds a new element of challenge as well as being able to earn Deluxe Coins without having to do a full run every time. All players have to die for the run to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms Deluxe 2 is a spin on The Backrooms Deluxe with new features such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match positive and negative effects that give you more or less Deluxe Coins at the end of your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Much better multiplayer replication</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game has been rewritten to support a much more seamless multiplayer experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has received more achievements, as well as support for non-Steam achievements (only in the game but don't affect Steam progression) for harder challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the original game, permadeath has been added, which adds a new element of challenge as well as being able to earn Deluxe Coins without having to do a full run every time. All players have to die for the run to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A roguelite multiplayer Backrooms game that bases itself on The Backrooms Deluxe's levels and expands on the mechanics, levels, networking and enemy AI.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
